--- WHAT IS FROZEN ---
  transported energy    rho * cp(T,Y) * T          [J/m^3], sensible, zero at T=0
  chemical pool         rho * sum_i Y_i h_f,i      [J/m^3]
  conserved total       E = sensible + chemical
  source                S_E = -sum_i h_f,i omega_i = -sum_r q_r Delta H_r   [W/m^3]
  reaction enthalpy     Delta H_r = sum_i nu_i hbar_f,i,  hbar_f,i = M_i h_f,i  [J/mol]
  sign                  Delta H_r < 0 exothermic; q_r > 0 forward; S_E > 0 adds heat
  double counting       IMPOSSIBLE -- no formation energy is in the transported variable
  h_f treatment         a NEW distinct quantity; NOT SensibleEnthalpy::referenceEnthalpy
  coupling              EXPLICIT operator splitting; one q_r per step shared by P18.4+P18.6

